WEBVTT

00:00:03.742 --> 00:00:08.353
Candy thought this patient
was grandfather William.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:13.281
And she came across weird Mr. McGregor.

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:20.210
However, Candy still treated
this weird old man...

00:00:20.316 --> 00:00:26.206
as if he was grandfather William
and took care of him.

00:00:29.689 --> 00:00:35.203
Where is she?

00:01:21.954 --> 00:01:26.875
How can open Mr. McGregor's heart?

00:01:29.219 --> 00:01:30.886
Mr. Cartwright,

00:01:31.798 --> 00:01:33.202
Sister Gray,

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.719
The mistress here Merry Jane,

00:01:37.322 --> 00:01:40.530
I met a lot of stubborn people before.

00:01:41.038 --> 00:01:43.310
Mr. McGregor is different to them.

00:01:50.949 --> 00:01:55.298
I am losing my confidence.

00:01:57.277 --> 00:01:58.613
Beautiful!

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.940
Do not pick up flowers.

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:09.722
No one is watching.

00:02:15.055 --> 00:02:16.756
- Mom!
- Yes?

00:02:17.098 --> 00:02:19.267
That nurse picked up flowers
without permission.

00:02:19.642 --> 00:02:21.343
A nurse?

00:02:23.526 --> 00:02:25.660
I did not see anything.

00:02:25.735 --> 00:02:27.870
She did pick up the flowers.

00:02:28.213 --> 00:02:29.982
The nurse?

00:02:34.607 --> 00:02:36.605
Did she eat it?

00:02:51.583 --> 00:02:53.580
He is still sleeping.

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:06.240
He is so peaceful when sleeping
but becomes so restless when he gets up!

00:03:06.482 --> 00:03:09.187
Maybe the room is too dull.

00:03:10.734 --> 00:03:12.332
Smells good.

00:03:13.179 --> 00:03:15.381
I will decorate it with some flowers.

00:03:15.455 --> 00:03:17.624
What is with the flowers?

00:03:19.105 --> 00:03:23.682
Mr. McGregor, you are up?

00:03:23.758 --> 00:03:27.641
I don't like flowers, take them away.

00:03:27.743 --> 00:03:30.482
How can someone dislike flowers?

00:03:30.555 --> 00:03:32.496
What are you murmuring?

00:03:32.564 --> 00:03:34.127
Sorry!

00:03:34.372 --> 00:03:37.215
I am here to say hello to you.

00:03:38.959 --> 00:03:44.975
I will look after you
instead of Franny.

00:03:45.052 --> 00:03:47.552
Candy is at your service.

00:03:48.634 --> 00:03:52.083
Candy?
Cute name but not the face.

00:03:52.686 --> 00:03:55.094
You are right.

00:03:57.407 --> 00:04:00.512
What are you laughing at?
Take the flowers away.

00:04:01.559 --> 00:04:03.157
What a miserable hospital!

00:04:03.233 --> 00:04:06.212
That nurse before
looked like a snow woman.

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.755
Snow woman? Franny?

00:04:09.828 --> 00:04:12.398
Here comes the freckled idiot.

00:04:12.474 --> 00:04:15.317
Freckled idiot?

00:04:15.387 --> 00:04:18.194
I must stay calm.

00:04:19.103 --> 00:04:21.774
What is so funny, freckled idiot?

00:04:24.259 --> 00:04:27.729
I have been tolerating him.

00:04:34.236 --> 00:04:37.740
I won't waste them,
I will take them back to the hostel.

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:41.297
I am thirsty!

00:04:41.369 --> 00:04:42.864
Coming!

00:04:53.053 --> 00:04:54.457
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:04:54.526 --> 00:04:55.690
What is this?

00:04:55.764 --> 00:04:56.894
Tea.

00:04:57.539 --> 00:04:59.571
I am hungry.

00:04:59.648 --> 00:05:01.590
You said you were thirsty.

00:05:02.361 --> 00:05:03.924
I changed my mind.

00:05:05.073 --> 00:05:07.344
I need to bear with this.

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:09.113
Sorry!

00:05:09.325 --> 00:05:11.563
Bring me food!

00:05:11.635 --> 00:05:13.667
Yes! Please wait!

00:05:13.744 --> 00:05:15.719
Freckled idiot.

00:05:16.590 --> 00:05:18.758
Sorry to keep you waiting,
here are the cookies.

00:05:18.833 --> 00:05:20.774
You fool, listen...

00:05:20.975 --> 00:05:23.419
when I am thirsty and hungry...

00:05:23.488 --> 00:05:24.926
bring me fruits!

00:05:24.994 --> 00:05:26.398
Yes!

00:05:27.405 --> 00:05:30.909
- Please!
- No I am hungry.

00:05:31.322 --> 00:05:32.520
I want some tea.

00:05:33.231 --> 00:05:34.966
- Coming.
- I want some juice.

00:05:35.273 --> 00:05:37.042
- Please.
- Coffee.

00:05:37.549 --> 00:05:38.987
I will get some juice.

00:05:39.056 --> 00:05:41.395
Not this one.

00:05:42.805 --> 00:05:46.253
- Quick!
- Yes!

00:05:57.002 --> 00:06:00.450
I am so tired, what a stubborn old man.

00:06:01.656 --> 00:06:04.259
I wonder how Franny tolerated this.

00:06:04.334 --> 00:06:07.245
Candy, shouldn't you be doing
your homework for tomorrow?

00:06:07.314 --> 00:06:10.053
I need to rest.

00:06:10.127 --> 00:06:12.661
You are so lazy!

00:06:12.738 --> 00:06:16.151
Snow woman! what a description.

00:06:17.292 --> 00:06:19.460
Candy, what are you laughing at?

00:06:19.937 --> 00:06:23.440
Nothing, I will start preparing.

00:06:25.494 --> 00:06:28.371
Franny,
isn't this the test for wounds?

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:31.317
-Yes!
-It is internal medicine tomorrow.

00:06:31.488 --> 00:06:34.295
I am doing this for the future.

00:06:34.366 --> 00:06:35.497
What do you mean?

00:06:35.572 --> 00:06:39.956
A lot of nurse will be needed
once the war starts.

00:06:40.026 --> 00:06:41.087
War?

00:06:41.164 --> 00:06:42.967
It has been pretty peaceful.

00:06:43.173 --> 00:06:45.513
Do you think it has been peaceful?

00:06:45.583 --> 00:06:48.460
Franny, where do you think
the war will start?

00:06:48.529 --> 00:06:50.470
- Europe.
- How about England?

00:06:50.538 --> 00:06:52.239
Of course!

00:06:52.313 --> 00:06:55.726
Annie is in England,
the war is going to start soon.

00:07:17.658 --> 00:07:23.172
That means
I won't be able to write to Annie.

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:28.729
Candy, please don't disturb me,
I need to study.

00:07:29.511 --> 00:07:31.246
Sorry!

00:07:38.149 --> 00:07:39.986
War...

00:07:40.426 --> 00:07:43.873
Is Mr. McGregor sleeping?

00:07:47.223 --> 00:07:51.766
Come to think about it,
I am the same as Mr. McGregor.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:57.123
There is no one that I can talk to.

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:04.727
I miss Annie,
I have so much to talk to Patty.

00:08:05.234 --> 00:08:09.779
Yes! I can talk to Mr. McGregor.

00:08:17.054 --> 00:08:19.623
It's none of your business,
freckled idiot!

00:08:19.699 --> 00:08:21.069
Sorry!

00:08:21.138 --> 00:08:25.111
I thought you were
looking for someone to talk to.

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:26.422
So I volunteered.

00:08:26.495 --> 00:08:29.771
I don't want to see a stupid nurse.

00:08:31.015 --> 00:08:33.391
You will be fired you if you keep talking.

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:36.668
Yes! Sorry to disturb you.

00:08:40.056 --> 00:08:44.907
Poor Mr. McGregor!
He does not want to see anyone.

00:08:45.881 --> 00:08:48.083
Headmistress Merry Jane.

00:08:49.061 --> 00:08:51.595
Follow me to my room.

00:08:54.384 --> 00:08:57.559
What is now, freckled idiot?

00:08:57.633 --> 00:09:00.772
Does headmistress know about it?

00:09:00.948 --> 00:09:03.082
Doctor Frank has told me.

00:09:03.158 --> 00:09:07.804
Headmistress, please allow me
to look after Mr. McGregor.

00:09:07.878 --> 00:09:12.387
- No one says you are fired.
- But...

00:09:12.532 --> 00:09:14.940
Since you started to look after him,

00:09:15.009 --> 00:09:17.714
Mr. McGregor feels better.

00:09:17.822 --> 00:09:20.494
- Really?
- It is too early to be happy.

00:09:20.568 --> 00:09:22.200
Doctor Frank said that...

00:09:22.276 --> 00:09:26.248
It is nice to have someone
so hardworking like you.

00:09:26.527 --> 00:09:32.543
By having you staying by the side
there might be some surprising progress.

00:09:32.721 --> 00:09:36.191
It was impossible to convince him.

00:09:36.337 --> 00:09:39.876
Is that a compliment?

00:09:39.953 --> 00:09:43.457
Think about it yourself.

00:09:45.511 --> 00:09:48.456
Keep it up.

00:09:48.524 --> 00:09:49.620
Yes!

00:09:49.696 --> 00:09:53.577
- Oh! There is a letter for you.
- For me?

00:09:53.848 --> 00:09:55.755
I think it is from London.

00:09:59.875 --> 00:10:01.781
It's from Annie !

00:10:02.252 --> 00:10:04.855
- You can read it.
- Yes.

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:06.299
See you!

00:10:06.738 --> 00:10:09.410
- Close the door!
- Oh, no!

00:10:22.306 --> 00:10:25.445
Candy, it's nice to receive your letter,
we are relieved.

00:10:25.521 --> 00:10:27.519
Everyone is talking about it.

00:10:27.596 --> 00:10:29.571
Brother, let me see it.

00:10:29.639 --> 00:10:31.547
Me too...

00:10:31.715 --> 00:10:33.484
Everyone is so eager to see your letter.

00:10:33.557 --> 00:10:37.906
I have almost memorized everything.

00:10:38.345 --> 00:10:41.621
Since you left...

00:10:41.961 --> 00:10:47.577
Archie wears the same fashionable
costume every day.

00:10:53.645 --> 00:10:56.215
Everyone seems alright
after receiving your letter.

00:10:58.668 --> 00:11:03.451
Candy, we didn't expect that
you are going to be a nurse.

00:11:04.828 --> 00:11:07.100
Nothing has changed at St. Paul Academy.

00:11:07.708 --> 00:11:11.451
Since you left,
it has been so quiet here.

00:11:11.792 --> 00:11:15.535
Everyone is lifeless.

00:11:16.646 --> 00:11:18.953
The school rules became stricter,

00:11:19.024 --> 00:11:21.330
but the point is...

00:11:21.402 --> 00:11:24.815
we still seem to hear your laughter
in school.

00:11:26.089 --> 00:11:30.564
We are looking forward to see you
in the white dress.

00:11:30.642 --> 00:11:33.553
Regards, Archie.

00:11:42.629 --> 00:11:47.081
Candy, it is really excellent of you
to go back to America by yourself.

00:11:47.986 --> 00:11:49.184
Patty!

00:11:49.359 --> 00:11:54.142
A few days ago.
Stear and I went to the zoo to see Yuli.

00:11:54.346 --> 00:11:57.657
It seemed to be surprised.

00:11:57.963 --> 00:12:01.741
because I have a boyfriend
right next to me.

00:12:01.947 --> 00:12:04.550
I want to get married with Stear.

00:12:04.725 --> 00:12:06.198
I am sure of that!

00:12:06.568 --> 00:12:08.337
Patty looked so happy.

00:12:08.409 --> 00:12:12.918
I am glad that they are happy.
They didn't mention any war

00:12:12.996 --> 00:12:15.234
Franny is having too much thought.

00:12:15.306 --> 00:12:19.221
Annie's letter,
it is in the same envelope as Patty's.

00:12:21.065 --> 00:12:22.331
Annie.

00:12:22.505 --> 00:12:27.755
Archie, Stear and Patty,
they always come up with good news.

00:12:27.828 --> 00:12:31.367
But, my letter is different from theirs.

00:12:32.047 --> 00:12:35.826
I have to tell you the truth.

00:12:38.408 --> 00:12:40.542
Is Germany starting war?

00:12:41.622 --> 00:12:45.035
Is there any news from America?

00:12:45.104 --> 00:12:48.482
I heard that Europe is ready for war.

00:12:48.586 --> 00:12:53.198
Relax,
it is not as easy as you thought.

00:12:53.274 --> 00:12:57.555
I had a bad feeling about this before.

00:12:58.463 --> 00:12:59.958
It is getting worse lately.

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:09.770
Patty, wake up.

00:13:10.415 --> 00:13:12.013
Patty.

00:13:12.258 --> 00:13:13.992
Please, wake up.

00:13:14.266 --> 00:13:15.533
Annie, what is the matter?

00:13:15.605 --> 00:13:19.612
Patty, did you hear gun shots?

00:13:20.728 --> 00:13:22.395
Gun shots?

00:13:23.842 --> 00:13:26.079
Has the war started?

00:13:26.386 --> 00:13:30.667
Stear told me
that was just night rehearsal.

00:13:30.739 --> 00:13:35.317
Why do we need rehearsal?
Is there any war coming?

00:13:35.393 --> 00:13:39.399
Annie, Archie and Stear
don't think there will be any war.

00:13:43.161 --> 00:13:45.193
Candy, I am scared.

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:47.747
I want to go back to America.

00:13:47.815 --> 00:13:50.257
I miss you so much Candy.

00:13:51.564 --> 00:13:54.601
I miss you too, Annie.

00:14:09.544 --> 00:14:11.039
Mr. McGregor?

00:14:27.824 --> 00:14:32.037
I am sorry that I was not by his side.

00:14:32.512 --> 00:14:34.920
I...

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:38.631
Calm down now, don't panic.

00:14:38.806 --> 00:14:40.677
Now, ready for injection.

00:14:51.798 --> 00:14:53.361
Mina...

00:14:55.045 --> 00:14:56.209
Mina?

00:14:56.384 --> 00:14:59.329
Whose name was Mr. McGregor calling?

00:15:00.535 --> 00:15:01.768
Mina.

00:15:03.817 --> 00:15:05.585
How is it going?

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:09.809
Not good, tonight will be crucial.

00:15:09.877 --> 00:15:12.754
Tonight will be crucial?

00:15:13.224 --> 00:15:15.896
Check his pulse every ten minutes.

00:15:15.971 --> 00:15:18.607
Keep me informed.

00:15:19.151 --> 00:15:23.969
Doctor, please save Mr. McGregor.

00:15:24.742 --> 00:15:26.044
Candy!

00:15:39.375 --> 00:15:42.012
Mina, come and see me.

00:15:42.086 --> 00:15:43.524
Mr. McGregor.

00:15:43.626 --> 00:15:46.571
Mina, I want to see you.

00:15:46.639 --> 00:15:48.340
Mr. McGregor.

00:15:51.327 --> 00:15:52.960
How is the situation?

00:15:54.005 --> 00:15:56.574
- Still the same.
- Yeah?

00:15:56.985 --> 00:16:00.193
I want to go back to the hostel.

00:16:01.036 --> 00:16:02.600
Ok, go ahead.

00:16:04.017 --> 00:16:06.824
- You want to go looking for Mina?
- Yes!

00:16:06.896 --> 00:16:09.703
Maybe she is his daughter
or granddaughter.

00:16:09.775 --> 00:16:12.846
But do you know where she is?

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:18.238
Mr. McGregor's family
should know about it.

00:16:18.312 --> 00:16:20.446
- Headmistress Merry Jane.
- Yes?

00:16:20.522 --> 00:16:26.310
Whom does the patient want to see,
has nothing to do with the nurse!

00:16:26.381 --> 00:16:27.580
Franny!

00:16:27.654 --> 00:16:31.261
Candy,
the most important thing now is...

00:16:31.337 --> 00:16:34.442
to save Mr. McGregor.

00:16:34.518 --> 00:16:37.622
Franny is right.

00:16:37.799 --> 00:16:39.031
Headmistress!

00:16:39.104 --> 00:16:42.643
But, that is normally
what a nurse assumes.

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:46.223
You are not qualified as nurses yet.

00:16:46.303 --> 00:16:47.969
So can I go?

00:16:48.044 --> 00:16:51.355
I allow you to take hospital's carriage.

00:16:51.426 --> 00:16:53.093
Thank you!

00:16:54.272 --> 00:16:55.904
Headmistress!

00:16:55.979 --> 00:17:00.260
You need to remember that doctors
and medicine is not the only cure.

00:17:27.551 --> 00:17:30.462
Please hurry!

00:17:30.866 --> 00:17:31.801
God!

00:17:31.871 --> 00:17:35.820
I pray for Mr. McGregor's safety
before he finds Mina.

00:17:39.471 --> 00:17:42.645
Get ready for intra-arterial injection.

00:18:02.741 --> 00:18:07.592
Mr. McGregor has his family to remember,
he is not lonely.

00:18:08.064 --> 00:18:10.302
I wish Mina was here.

00:18:42.583 --> 00:18:45.562
It looks like the Adley's place
in Lakewood.

00:19:02.906 --> 00:19:05.040
It's so desolate!

00:19:14.725 --> 00:19:18.229
Does Mr. McGregor really live here?

00:19:20.283 --> 00:19:22.281
Anybody home?

00:19:23.932 --> 00:19:26.501
Looks like no one is home.

00:19:26.577 --> 00:19:31.257
Anybody home?

00:19:31.532 --> 00:19:33.804
Anybody home?

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:37.788
Looks like no one is home.

00:19:40.472 --> 00:19:43.315
What is the matter at this time?

00:19:43.385 --> 00:19:44.880
Are you Ms. Mina?

00:19:44.958 --> 00:19:46.453
Mina?

00:19:46.867 --> 00:19:50.610
Sorry, is Mina home?

00:19:51.085 --> 00:19:53.287
Yes, what is the matter?

00:19:53.362 --> 00:19:58.442
I am a nurse from Joseph Hospital,
I came to pick up Ms. Mina.

00:19:58.518 --> 00:19:59.785
- Mina?
- Yes!

00:19:59.858 --> 00:20:02.894
Mr. McGregor calls out Mina's name.

00:20:02.971 --> 00:20:04.273
- Master?
- Yes.

00:20:04.779 --> 00:20:08.421
He does not seem too good.
I want them to meet each other.

00:20:08.496 --> 00:20:11.029
She is sleeping in the yard,
go see her yourself.

00:20:11.945 --> 00:20:14.045
Please... the yard?

00:20:36.753 --> 00:20:39.664
The yard... here?

00:20:40.302 --> 00:20:44.081
Strange! I can only see a dog sleeping.

00:20:46.698 --> 00:20:48.227
Do you know Mina?

00:20:49.243 --> 00:20:51.149
Do you know where Ms. Mina is?

00:20:53.997 --> 00:20:56.439
Ms. Mina?

00:20:57.245 --> 00:20:59.014
Ms. Mina?

00:20:59.622 --> 00:21:02.190
This dog... It can't be!

00:21:03.304 --> 00:21:04.605
Mina.

00:21:07.589 --> 00:21:09.461
Are you Mina?

00:21:12.479 --> 00:21:14.112
No, Mina!

00:21:15.826 --> 00:21:19.707
The Mina
that Mr. McGregor was talking about

00:21:19.778 --> 00:21:22.083
turns out to be this big dog.

00:21:22.155 --> 00:21:24.792
Candy is amazed!
